{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519801-simple-question-can-qualmi-eat-salmon","id":1519801,"title":"Simple question: Can Qualmi eat salmon?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-04T16:39:20-07:00","id":1519801,"title":"Simple question: Can Qualmi eat salmon?","content":"Feel free to discuss.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23984-thkaal","name":"Thkaal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-04T17:17:49-07:00","id":1519806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thkaal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1519801-simple-question-can-qualmi-eat-salmon#post1519801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Feel free to discuss.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is this another case of &quot;Can Garou have chocolate&quot; ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-04T17:42:46-07:00","id":1519812,"title":"","content":"No? Bobcats and lynxes are perfectly capable of consuming fish - including salmon - in their diets. They just don't eat much fish because they're not as well adapted for fishing as some other cats, and as medium sized cats, they generally get chased off of easy fishing spots by bears. It's rarely seen, but there is direct evidence of them eating salmon in the wild if the opportunity presents itself.<br /> <br /> I believe the issues is their Yava, which includes, &quot;The Qualmi share a soul with the salmon; poison the salmon, and you harm the tribe.&quot; As secret methods of attacking the Bastet, the Yava are supposed to offer sideways options for going after them. Qualmi miight not like eating salmon because of this, but predators eating salmon is part of the natural food web. It's hard to say that it &quot;poisons&quot; salmon in fashion that would bring them soul-harm; otherwise the Qualmi would be pretty screwed ever salmon run when lots of animals are feasting on salmon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-05T04:56:05-07:00","id":1519844,"title":"","content":"Ah, forgot about that. Reading into it, I feel that this might not be a taboo against eating salmon. I think the idea is that they must protect the salmon and damage against local salmon is damage against them. So misfortune, miscarriage, poor crops... And even worse with them celebrating and enjoying salmon, possibily in a ritualistic manner of how brother feeds brother, this would be a perfect way to poison them and destroy them from within!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}